Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Vault server won't start

Solution: Check if port 8200 is already in use: netstat -tlnp | grep 8200
Solution: Verify configuration file syntax: vault server -config=/opt/vault/config/vault.hcl -test
Issue: Cannot unseal Vault

Solution: Ensure you're using the correct unseal keys from initialization
Solution: Check that you're providing at least the threshold number of keys (3 in our case)
Issue: Permission denied when accessing secrets

Solution: Verify your token is set: echo $VAULT_TOKEN
Solution: Check if your token has the necessary permissions
Issue: Secret not found

Solution: Verify the correct path format for KV v2: secret-v2/data/path vs secret-v2/path
Solution: Use vault kv list to see available secrets
Issue: Version not found in KV v2

Solution: Check available versions: vault kv metadata get path/to/secret
Solution: Verify the version wasn't destroyed: destroyed versions cannot be recovered
